KoboldCpp runs AI models on your own computer. This wiki has the details. New to it? The [beginner guide](/getting-started/) takes you from download to your first chat in four steps. The project also has its own [wiki on GitHub](https://github.com/LostRuins/koboldcpp/wiki).

## Download and install

Every release file and what it needs: [Release files and system requirements](/docs/install/releases/). Step by step for [Windows](/docs/install/windows/), [Linux](/docs/install/linux/), [macOS](/docs/install/macos/), [Android](/docs/install/android/), and [Colab and Docker](/docs/install/colab-docker/). Also: [Updating](/docs/install/updating/), [Build from source](/docs/install/from-source/) and [Staying safe](/docs/install/staying-safe/).

