The [launcher tour](/docs/settings/launcher-tour/) explains every tab. Also: [Context size](/docs/settings/context-size/), [Config files](/docs/settings/config-files/), [Templates](/docs/settings/templates/), [Command line](/docs/settings/command-line/), [Admin mode](/docs/settings/admin-mode/).

